to mitigate a vulnerability.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:definition</td><td align='left'>&quot;Records the time when a recommended action was communicated in a VEX statement
to mitigate a vulnerability.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:note</td><td align='left'>&quot;When a VEX statement communicates an affected status, the author shall
include an action statement with a recommended action to help mitigate the
vulnerability&#x27;s impact. The actionStatementTime property records the time
when the action statement was first communicated.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
